!profiles/**/.*
!.repo/

# project-local vscode workspace settings
!.vscode/
!.vscode/settings.json

# exported default config / keybindings of vscode
**/Code/User/.exported/*
!**/Code/User/.exported/.gitkeep


__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/


/root/etc/**/*local*
##[>] 🤖
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
/assets/data/makefile.agents.md
/assets/data/repo-structure.md
/assets/data/conventions.md
/assets/docs-agents/purpose.md
/assets/docs-agents/file-naming.md

#[why] AI prose payloads: authored in prose, rendered here by repo/genfiles, loaded onto the host from this tree
/profiles/llm/base/root/_home/.config/ai-agents/docs/*.md
/profiles/llm/base/root/_home/.config/ai-agents/templates/AGENTS.md.ontoHost.tpl
/profiles/llm/base/root/usr/local/scripts/shell/templates-llm/*.tmpl.md
/profiles/llm/claude/root/_home/.config/claude/output-styles/*.md
/profiles/llm/claude/root/_home/.config/claude/rules/**/*.md
#[why] skills render as directories, so the SKILL.md and any sibling payload are ignored while the
#   hand-written scripts/ helpers beside them stay tracked
/profiles/llm/claude/root/_home/.config/claude/skills/**/SKILL.md
##[<] 🤖
